name 'aif-y2-natural-language-processing-preassessment-q10-2026'

wrong 'It finds the training review sharing the most words with the new one and copies its category'
right "It uses the review's words to predict how probable each category is, then picks the most probable one"
wrong 'It asks a chain of yes-or-no questions about the review until it reaches a category'
wrong 'It counts the positive and negative words from a fixed list and picks the category with more'

